{"parse":{"title":"【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·二","pageid":3200,"revid":6769,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E7%AF%87%C2%B7%E4%BA%8C&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E7%AF%87%C2%B7%E4%BA%8C&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E7%AF%87%C2%B7%E4%BA%8C&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%A7%91%E6%99%AE\" title=\"科普\">科普</a> &gt; <b>【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·二</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E3.80.90.E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E7.BA.AA.E4.BA.8B.E7.B0.BF.E3.80.91.E9.AA.91.E5.A3.AB.E5.90.8C.E7.9B.9F.E7.AF.87.C2.B7.E4.BA.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·二\">【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·二</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E7%BA%AA%E4%BA%8B%E7%B0%BF%E3%80%91%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E7%AF%87%C2%B7%E4%BA%8C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·二\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：极心测试的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-10-04 14:26<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FF81v3Xb4cfyIYSALgDYxiw\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/F81v3Xb4cfyIYSALgDYxiw</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"120\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>各位团长好！<br />\n今天继续给大家带来<br />\n<font color=\"blue\"><b>骑士诸国同盟</b></font>的介绍<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息249.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/eqxtgow1viaiqsahxkhm535ttoagf1d.png/150px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF249.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"154\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/eqxtgow1viaiqsahxkhm535ttoagf1d.png/225px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF249.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/68/eqxtgow1viaiqsahxkhm535ttoagf1d.png/300px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF249.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1112\" /><img alt=\"官方消息160.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e1/a7vq7wb84pph4k1n5zfz0sueqlv2kyz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n<table style=\"width:90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><font color=\"blue\"><b>第一次光辉之战</b></font>后，那些曾经放弃骑士身份与誓言的人们，已经跨越大洋冒险，在<font color=\"blue\"><b>美尼亚大陆</b></font>上零散建立了<font color=\"blue\"><b>新势力</b></font>。<br /><font color=\"blue\"><b>联盟</b></font>垂涎于新大陆的<font color=\"blue\"><b>资源</b></font>，意图通过<font color=\"blue\"><b>武装暴力</b></font>将其<font color=\"blue\"><b>征服</b></font>，不料<font color=\"blue\"><b>战火</b></font>反而促成了新大陆的<font color=\"blue\"><b>联邦</b></font>诞生......<br /><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><img alt=\"官方消息255.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/91/ofbyn42dkoy3ccq3g9qvhdxq3u70ccj.png/500px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF255.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"769\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/91/ofbyn42dkoy3ccq3g9qvhdxq3u70ccj.png/750px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF255.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/91/ofbyn42dkoy3ccq3g9qvhdxq3u70ccj.png/1000px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF255.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1662\" /><img alt=\"官方消息162.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d6/svw1kgm80z16l73m4cyr5qbzzppqu7h.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n一边是<font color=\"blue\"><b>衰落的法皇国</b></font><br />\n一边是<font color=\"blue\"><b>快速崛起的美尼亚联邦</b></font><br />\n骑士团<font color=\"blue\"><b>审时度势</b></font><br />\n做出了自己的选择\n<br /><br />\n然而随着<font color=\"blue\"><b>晶石资源</b></font>被发现<br />\n骑士团的<font color=\"blue\"><b>选择</b></font><br />\n又突然变得<font color=\"blue\"><b>摇摆</b></font>了起来...<br />\n敬请期待<font color=\"blue\"><b>【骑士同盟篇·三】</b></font>\n</p>\n</center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021211316\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 105/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2398/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 280/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.956      1 -total\n 56.18%   15.144      1 模板:面包屑\n 43.45%   11.713      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3200-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261021211316 and revision id 6769. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"科普","missing":true}],"images":["官方消息139.png","官方消息249.png","官方消息160.png","官方消息255.png","官方消息162.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·二","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·二","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·二"}],"displaytitle":"【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·二","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|科普}}\n=【铃兰纪事簿】骑士同盟篇·二=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=科普\n|时间= 2023-10-04 14:26\n|作者=极心测试的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/F81v3Xb4cfyIYSALgDYxiw\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<br>\n[[File:官方消息139.png|link=]]\n<center>\n各位团长好！<br>\n今天继续给大家带来<br>\n<font color=blue>'''骑士诸国同盟'''</font>的介绍<br>\n[[File:官方消息249.png|150px|link=]][[File:官方消息160.png|link=]]\n{|style=\"width:90%\"\n|<font color=blue>'''第一次光辉之战'''</font>后，那些曾经放弃骑士身份与誓言的人们，已经跨越大洋冒险，在<font color=blue>'''美尼亚大陆'''</font>上零散建立了<font color=blue>'''新势力'''</font>。<br><font color=blue>'''联盟'''</font>垂涎于新大陆的<font color=blue>'''资源'''</font>，意图通过<font color=blue>'''武装暴力'''</font>将其<font color=blue>'''征服'''</font>，不料<font color=blue>'''战火'''</font>反而促成了新大陆的<font color=blue>'''联邦'''</font>诞生......<br><br>\n|}\n[[File:官方消息255.png|500px|link=]][[File:官方消息162.png|link=]]\n一边是<font color=blue>'''衰落的法皇国'''</font><br>\n一边是<font color=blue>'''快速崛起的美尼亚联邦'''</font><br>\n骑士团<font color=blue>'''审时度势'''</font><br>\n做出了自己的选择\n<br><br>\n然而随着<font color=blue>'''晶石资源'''</font>被发现<br>\n骑士团的<font color=blue>'''选择'''</font><br>\n又突然变得<font color=blue>'''摇摆'''</font>了起来...<br>\n敬请期待<font color=blue>'''【骑士同盟篇·三】'''</font>\n</center>\n<br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:37:34.139494+00:00"}